WEBVTT

00:00:00.493 --> 00:00:01.145
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:04.135
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I eat too much chocolate.

00:00:04.339 --> 00:00:06.061
I’m going to try and give it up.

00:00:07.989 --> 00:00:08.620
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:09.658 --> 00:00:11.030
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> My laptop’s broken.

00:00:11.438 --> 00:00:12.725
I can’t turn it on.

00:00:14.665 --> 00:00:15.415
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:16.476 --> 00:00:18.756
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> That’s my jacket! Take it off!

00:00:20.728 --> 00:00:21.354
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:22.297 --> 00:00:24.435
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> This camera cost a lot of money.

00:00:24.787 --> 00:00:25.949
Please look after it!

00:00:27.916 --> 00:00:28.642
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:29.652 --> 00:00:31.453
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> This jumper looks nice.

00:00:31.799 --> 00:00:33.933
Is there anywhere I can try it on?

00:00:35.929 --> 00:00:36.706
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:39.269
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Your pen doesn’t work.

00:00:39.495 --> 00:00:40.856
You should throw it away.